rker it [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]writes, and the runner adoption that continues as the piped successor.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]The `/sase_pipe` skill and user documentation[/bold #D7AFFF]                 [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]skill[dim] · [dim][/dim]after pipe[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]skill: author the bundled skill source, wire it into the skill [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]enumeration tests, and document the command across the CLI, monitor, and[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]xprompt docs.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  6 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]End-to-end pipe exercises[/bold #D7AFFF]                                     [bold black on #5FD7AF] xsmall [/bold black on #5FD7AF]\n    [#AF87FF]smoke[dim] · [dim][/dim]after pipe, skill, spawn[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]smoke: run real agents that pipe, confirm the family chain and ACE rows,[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and land the epic on a full verification run.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-p8","llm_provider":"grok","model":"grok-4.6","patch_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","phase_bead_id":"sase-p8.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-6d6d32802cddf9ea717a953ef6e31521","started_at":"2026-08-17T23:03:19.879683+00:00","state":"active"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":[],"restartable":true},"commits":[{"committed_at":1787012650,"sha":"d8a903ac90085156e126de50e8c92a54a3ab7ad8","subject":"refactor(agent): share the out-of-process family-spawn primitive"}],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"commits":{"digest":"39953837633b3953bc37fd6d37b5ea8a01ab149090a529977643ee3e190c1bdf","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-p8.3/commits.json","size_bytes":242},"embedded_workflows":{"digest":"a398c70160fe308637edd70b38d8cf02cc697183c480675d10f387d529663058","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-p8.3/embedded_workflows.json","size